<div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="zh-Hans" dir="ltr"><div id="headerContainer">
<table style="width:100%; margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:3px;border:1px solid var(--border-color-content-added,#93A6C0); background-color: var(--background-color-neutral-subtle,#F9F9F9); color: inherit; text-align: center; text-wrap: balance;">

<tbody><tr>
<td style="width:0; text-align:left; font-size:small;">
</td>
<td style="width:25%; text-align:left; font-size:small;">
</td>
<td style="width:50%;"><b>礼记</b> <br /><span style="color:var(--color-placeholder,#999999)">辑者：</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Author:%E6%88%B4%E8%81%96&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1" class="new" title="Author:戴圣（页面不存在）">戴圣</a>
</td>
<td style="width:25%; text-align:right; font-size:small;">
</td>
<td class="noprint" style="width:0; text-align:right; font-size:small;">
</td></tr></tbody></table>
<table style="width:100%; background:var(--background-color-progressive-subtle,#F8FCFF); color: inherit;font-size:small; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color-content-added,#93A6C0)">

<tbody><tr>
<td>《礼记》，儒学经典之一，乃<span style="text-decoration: underline;-moz-text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-style: solid;text-underline-offset:0.25em;">孔子</span>门生及<span style="text-decoration: underline;-moz-text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-style: solid;text-underline-offset:0.25em;">战国</span>时儒家学者解说《礼经》与“礼学”的文集。诸篇什颇多且散传，作者姓名事历亦难确考，故《<a href="/wiki/%E6%BC%A2%E6%9B%B8/%E5%8D%B7030" title="汉书/卷030">汉书·艺文志</a>》泛称为：“《记》百三十一篇，七十子後学所记也。”至<span style="text-decoration: underline;-moz-text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-style: solid;text-underline-offset:0.25em;">汉</span>，儒生选辑“《礼》之记文”成书，以传授《<a href="/wiki/%E5%84%80%E7%A6%AE" title="仪礼">仪礼</a>》。<span style="text-decoration: underline;-moz-text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-style: solid;text-underline-offset:0.25em;">西汉</span>礼经博士<span style="text-decoration: underline;-moz-text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-style: solid;text-underline-offset:0.25em;">戴德</span>删简<span style="text-decoration: underline;-moz-text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-style: solid;text-underline-offset:0.25em;">刘向</span>所集百三十篇为八十五篇，称为《<a href="/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E6%88%B4%E7%A6%AE%E8%A8%98" title="大戴礼记">大戴〈礼记〉</a>》。后其姪<span style="text-decoration: underline;-moz-text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-style: solid;text-underline-offset:0.25em;">戴圣</span>删简《<a href="/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E6%88%B4%E7%A6%AE%E8%A8%98" title="大戴礼记">大戴〈礼记〉</a>》，得四十六篇，加之《月令》、《明堂位》与《乐记》，凡四十九篇，称为《小戴〈礼记〉》。至<span style="text-decoration: underline;-moz-text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-style: solid;text-underline-offset:0.25em;">隋</span><span style="text-decoration: underline;-moz-text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-style: solid;text-underline-offset:0.25em;">唐</span>，《<a href="/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E6%88%B4%E7%A6%AE%E8%A8%98" title="大戴礼记">大戴〈礼记〉</a>》已散逸大半，现传仅三十九篇。故今通行《礼记》多为《小戴〈礼记〉》。<ul id="plainSister" style="display:inline-block; font-size:93%; line-height:normal; list-style-type:none; list-style-image:none; list-style-position:outside; border:1px solid var(--border-color-base,#AAA); float:right; clear:right; margin:0.5ex 0.5ex 0.5ex 0.5ex; padding:0.0ex 0.0ex 0.0ex 0.0ex; background-color:var(--background-color-base,#FFFFFF);color: inherit;"><li class="sisitem"><span class="sisicon" style="padding-right:1ex;"><span typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="/wiki/Template:Textinfo" title="Template:Textinfo"><img alt="Documentation for the TextInfo template." src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Information_icon.svg/20px-Information_icon.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikisource.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Information_icon.svg/40px-Information_icon.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikisource.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="620" data-file-height="620" /></a></span></span><a href="/wiki/Talk:%E7%A6%AE%E8%A8%98" title="Talk:礼记">版本信息</a></li><li class="noprint sisitem"><span class="sisicon" style="padding-right:1ex;"><span typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="/wiki/Special:SiteMatrix" title="Special:SiteMatrix"><img alt="姊妹计划" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Wikimedia-logo.svg/20px-Wikimedia-logo.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikisource.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Wikimedia-logo.svg/40px-Wikimedia-logo.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikisource.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="1024" data-file-height="1024" /></a></span></span><a href="/wiki/Special:SiteMatrix" title="Special:SiteMatrix">姊妹计划</a>: <a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A4%BC%E8%AE%B0" class="extiw" title="w:礼记">百科</a>·<a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/zh-classical:%E7%A6%AE%E8%A8%98" class="extiw" title="w:zh-classical:礼记">大典</a>·<a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/wuu:%E7%A4%BC%E8%AE%B0" class="extiw" title="w:wuu:礼记">吴典</a>·<a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/zh-yue:%E7%A6%AE%E8%A8%98" class="extiw" title="w:zh-yue:礼记">粤典</a>·<a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:%E7%A6%AE%E8%A8%98" class="extiw" title="c:Category:礼记">图册分类</a>·<a href="https://zh.wikiquote.org/wiki/%E7%A6%AE%E8%A8%98" class="extiw" title="q:礼记">语录</a>·<a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q862758" class="extiw" title="d:Q862758">数据项</a></li></ul>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
